                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5b64e30d-f2c4-4d76-ae1f-8161269371e6",
                        "entry_id": "a0db77f1-2df6-3410-a239-949185ee977c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "wartimes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                        "entry_id": "a0db77f1-2df6-3410-a239-949185ee977c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A period during which a war is in progress in a particular place."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "attributive",
                            "countable",
                            "often",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cd80ed68-4724-4b77-8329-f13765d9e604",
                                "sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                                "text": "But, she says, a wartime ban on recordings using shellac and vinyl kept the Walker version from being released."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "712e4129-d981-4f89-af11-c910bd115a77",
                                "sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                                "text": "Significant rail projects have been mothballed before in the face of changed circumstances - in particular, the LNER Woodhead project which was postponed due to wartime conditions and not revived until 1948, as money became available after nationalisation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e3f461f8-aea0-4be4-a8ad-7e209cf36f5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a0db77f1-2df6-3410-a239-949185ee977c",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                        "source_sense_description": "period of a war",
                        "target_lang_word": "válečná doba",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7262845a-14cb-44da-a520-1101c87cbf4c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a0db77f1-2df6-3410-a239-949185ee977c",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                        "source_sense_description": "period of a war",
                        "target_lang_word": "oorlogstijd",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "oorlogstijd",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d9b1a771-89f9-3536-a303-78e0891b5792",
                                        "entry_id": "65d55660-2f95-3a3e-a92a-2269dd57ef60",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "de periode waarin men oorlog voert"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e21783f-f1aa-42ad-a7cf-945f3ad0b754",
                                                "sense_id": "d9b1a771-89f9-3536-a303-78e0891b5792",
                                                "text": "1940 - 1945 was een oorlogstijd in Nederland."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "960026ae-b18b-45b2-aa7e-cc9bf99e8081",
                                                "sense_id": "d9b1a771-89f9-3536-a303-78e0891b5792",
                                                "text": "Voor de scènes die hij in zijn cartoons weergeeft doet hij „inspiratie op in het dagelijks leven”. Poirrié: „Ik kan me voorstellen dat kleinkinderen opa’s spulletjes uit de oorlogstijd van de politionele acties op een rommelmarkt verkopen.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "962eae25-2acb-469f-b669-c4c09966de48",
                                                "sense_id": "d9b1a771-89f9-3536-a303-78e0891b5792",
                                                "text": "Haar vader had financiële problemen, Louise noch hij wist er de details van, maar ze hadden begrepen dat het om een paar minder geslaagde zaken ging, misschien zelfs van die zaken die zo nu en dan voorkomen in oorlogstijd, die zaken waarbij je het risico liep het slachtoffer te worden van minder gewetensvolle debiteurs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2342036a-b34a-497f-b1eb-b1d7256242b2",
                                                "sense_id": "d9b1a771-89f9-3536-a303-78e0891b5792",
                                                "text": "Oorlogstijd, crisistijd, rantsoentijd en een algemene bevolkingsgezondheid die beter was dan ooit omdat de mensen, de anderen dus, nooit suiker, vet, varkensvlees en absoluut geen ossenhaas binnen konden krijgen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5fe8fd4-724a-450e-9256-99fd80d4cc79",
                        "source_entry_id": "a0db77f1-2df6-3410-a239-949185ee977c",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                        "source_sense_description": "period of a war",
                        "target_lang_word": "temps de guerre",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "43bf9147-342c-49c8-98da-a4ca9ca51a5e",
                        "source_entry_id": "a0db77f1-2df6-3410-a239-949185ee977c",
                        "source_sense_id": "bf3aefb7-38ba-33ec-b669-e7c98f193c54",
                        "source_sense_description": "period of a war",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kriegszeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kriegszeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0f6037a-c822-33c7-98ed-2d4be4143428",
                                        "entry_id": "656a4695-3082-33d0-8b64-29c7a2a1a11d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zeit, in der Krieg herrscht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8909a6df-8fc9-4cde-8009-0ff107547979",
                                                "sense_id": "c0f6037a-c822-33c7-98ed-2d4be4143428",
                                                "text": "„Meine Nachfrage, ob hier seelische Verletzungen aus der Kriegszeit zugrunde liegen könnten, wischten die Älteren schnell vom Tisch.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3002ad43-e948-4fab-8485-d52bcefea8fa",
                                                "sense_id": "c0f6037a-c822-33c7-98ed-2d4be4143428",
                                                "text": "„Die belastenden Erlebnisse meiner mütterlichen und väterlichen Großeltern in Kriegs- und Nachkriegszeit wirken noch heute auf die Familie.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c451ae7-25e7-4977-adf4-018275bd42a6",
                                                "sense_id": "c0f6037a-c822-33c7-98ed-2d4be4143428",
                                                "text": "„Es klingt erstaunlich, dass ein Kind die Tragweite einer solchen Äußerung versteht, doch in Kriegszeiten werden Kinder viel früher erwachsen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99569401-8e31-4eea-880e-ce2afec16020",
                                                "sense_id": "c0f6037a-c822-33c7-98ed-2d4be4143428",
                                                "text": "„Was uns betraf, betrachteten wir sie allesamt als Feinde, und es war nur recht und billig, in Kriegszeiten auf ihre Kosten zu leben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
